── (A) apptainer instance logs (raw stdout/stderr) ──
$ apptainer instance logs hello-agent
$ ls "$APPTAINER_LOG_DIR/$(hostname)/$USER/"
scitex-test-user.err
scitex-test-user.out

── (B) Enter a running instance ──
$ apptainer exec instance://hello-agent bash
  # → interactive shell; ctrl-D to exit
$ apptainer exec instance://hello-agent env | grep CLAUDE
  # → see the env the agent actually has

── (C) sac agents tail (structured) ──
$ sac agents tail hello-agent -n 5
(no transcript for hello-agent)

── (D) Raw session.jsonl (the source of truth) ──
$ tail -3 /home/ywatanabe/.scitex/agent-container/runtime/hello-agent/session.jsonl | jq .type
(no session.jsonl — hello-agent has never run)

── (E) Human-readable summary ──
$ sac agents recall hello-agent
  # → "Last user turn: ...; last assistant action: ..."
